        <mxCell id="fr" value="&#128274;&#8205; RULE (mula sa PDF): &#8220;Every schema change is a reviewed file in the repository. No hand-edited databases, ever, including on Test.&#8221;&#10;Ang schema ay CODE, hindi database state.&#10;&#10;&#128193;&#8205; Connection path: VS Code &#8594; Eloquent Models &#8594; PgBouncer (:6543) &#8594; Supabase Postgres." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
