        <mxCell id="sum" value="&#128221;&#8205; BUOD&#10;1. SCHEMA = CODE. Lahat ng table structure ay nasa database/migrations/ at naka-version sa GitHub. Hindi ka kailanman mag-hahawo-edit ng DB.&#10;2. CONNECTION PATH: VS Code &#8594; Eloquent Models &#8594; PgBouncer (:6543) &#8594; Supabase Postgres.&#10;3. 8 domain tables + 2 Laravel system tables (cache, jobs).&#10;4. MIGRATION FILENAME ang tumatakda sa execution order &#8212; hindi ang petsa.&#10;5. Ang PDF ay TARGET/REFERENCE, hindi kasalukuyang estado. Kulang pa: CI pipeline, /health endpoint, automated backup, alerting." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="800" width="1570" height="150" as="geometry" />
